---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Authentication"
  description="Authentication of works by Oskar Schlemmer."
  currentPath="/authentication"
>
  <section class="main-section">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-regular w-container">
      <div class="text-block-2 white triadic-ballet">
        Authentication of Works by Oskar Schlemmer<br />Application Form
      </div>

      <p class="schlemmer-text one formspace formheadline">
        <strong class="formheadline">
          Invitation to collectors, auction houses, art dealers, art historians and museums
        </strong>
      </p>
      <p class="schlemmer-text one formspace _18">
        Call for information on works of art, photographs and documents by Oskar Schlemmer
        that have not yet been registered
      </p>

      <div class="schlemmer-text one formspace2" style="padding: 2rem 0;">
        <p>
          To submit an authentication request, please contact the Secretariat directly:
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Secretariat</strong><br />
          Vadakyil Changaramkumarath Mullassery<br />
          India
        </p>
        <p>
          Please include complete details: your name, institution, contact information,
          and a full description of your request (authentication, reproduction/publication,
          provenance research, art market, academia, media, or trademark).
        </p>
        <p>
          All information will be treated confidentially.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="schlemmer-text one formspace2">
        Please fill in all details. Forms that are incomplete, with mandatory information
        not filled in, cannot be considered and will not be followed up.<br /><br />
        Please contact us with information on previously unrecorded original works by
        Oskar Schlemmer. Information on changes of ownership, as well as information that
        was not correctly published in 1965 or 1979, can also be submitted.<br /><br />
        We will, of course, treat all information confidentially.<br /><br />
        Further information on Catalogues Raisonnés of artworks by Oskar Schlemmer,{' '}
        <a href="/catalogue-raisonne" class="schlemmer-link">see Oskar Schlemmer Literature</a>
        <br /><br />
        In the future, the internally updated catalogues raisonné will serve as an
        authoritative source of information on Oskar Schlemmer for researchers, museums,
        collectors, and art dealers upon request.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
